   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">This is something I’d really like to find a simple way to do!  Here is a modification of Alain’s answer:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:none repeat scroll 0% 0% rgb(248,248,248)\"></code></pre></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:none repeat scroll 0% 0% rgb(248,248,248)\">\r\ndf %&gt;% \r\n  group_by(x) %&gt;% \r\n  mutate(val = val/(end + <span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span></code></pre></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:none repeat scroll 0% 0% rgb(248,248,248)\"> - start)) %&gt;%\r\n  do(with(., data_frame(x, n = start:end, val = val)))\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">If you don’t name the result of <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">data_frame</code> within <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">do</code>, then the output won’t be stored in a list. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">What do we think about using <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">with()</code> inside <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">do()</code>? It certainly cleans up the syntax a bit in cases like this, where every variable was preceded by <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">.$</code></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj5UaGlzIGlzIHNvbWV0aGluZyBJJ2QgcmVhbGx5IGxpa2UgdG8gZmluZCBhIHNpbXBsZSB3\r\nYXkgdG8gZG8hJm5ic3A7IEhlcmUgaXMgYSBtb2RpZmljYXRpb24gb2YgQWxhaW4ncyBhbnN3ZXI6\r\nPGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PmBgYHI8YnI+PGRpdj5kZiAlJmd0OyUgPGJyPiZuYnNw\r\nOyBncm91cF9ieSh4KSAlJmd0OyUgPGJyPiZuYnNwOyBtdXRhdGUodmFsID0gdmFsLyhlbmQgKyAx\r\nIC0gc3RhcnQpKSAlJmd0OyU8YnI+Jm5ic3A7IGRvKHdpdGgoLiwgZGF0YV9mcmFtZSh4LCBuID0g\r\nc3RhcnQ6ZW5kLCB2YWwgPSB2YWwpKSk8YnI+YGBgPGJyPjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PklmIHlvdSBk\r\nb24ndCBuYW1lIHRoZSByZXN1bHQgb2YgYGRhdGFfZnJhbWVgIHdpdGhpbiBgZG9gLCB0aGVuIHRo\r\nZSBvdXRwdXQgd29uJ3QgYmUgc3RvcmVkIGluIGEgbGlzdC4gPGJyPjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pldo\r\nYXQgZG8gd2UgdGhpbmsgYWJvdXQgdXNpbmcgYHdpdGgoKWAgaW5zaWRlIGBkbygpYD8gSXQgY2Vy\r\ndGFpbmx5IGNsZWFucyB1cCB0aGUgc3ludGF4IGEgYml0IGluIGNhc2VzIGxpa2UgdGhpcywgd2hl\r\ncmUgZXZlcnkgdmFyaWFibGUgd2FzIHByZWNlZGVkIGJ5IGAuJGA8YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+\r\nPC9kaXY+\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div>"
